  "description": "The 55\" Tow Behind Box Scraper is the perfect tool to help you achieve the stunning lawn you've always dreamed of. With its generous working width, it can cover a wider area, saving you time and effort.\nFitment\nDesigned to fit both CAT-0 and CAT-1 tractors, this box scraper offers compatibility with a wide range of tractor models. It comes with mounting brackets that allow for easy installation on most tractors without the need for additional modifications or equipment.\nFeatures\n55\" Working Width: 55\" Tow Behind Box Scraper will help you grow the beautiful lawn that you've always wanted.\nEfficient work completion: Six adjustable and replaceable cutting-edge rippers. Reversible and replaceable blade wear bar.\nCompatibility: Fits both CAT-0 and CAT-1 tractors; Product contains mounting brackets so you can easily install it on most tractors without additional modifications\nRust Resistant Coating: All steel design plus black rust-resistant coated finishing prevents rusting for continued use throughout the seasons.\nDurable construction: The trailing box scraper has been upgraded and is designed to flatten the surface of the land.",
